/E (TasteTrail is a new, self-contained web application. It is designed as a user-facing restaurant discovery platform and can initially operate using mock restaurant data or external location/place APIs. The architecture is kept modular so that live restaurant information, authentication, reviews and recommendation services can be integrated in future versions.)
