/E (TasteTrail is proposed as a frontend-centered web architecture. The presentation layer contains the React user interface and reusable components. A service/data layer handles mock JSON data and optional external REST APIs for restaurant, geolocation and map information. A backend/database can be introduced in a future phase for persistent accounts, reviews and favourites.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [52]
>>
